        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Will Durant, Margaret Mitchell\n- Works: Gone with the Wind\n- Civilization: Minoan civilization\n- Topics: American literature, historiography\n\nFacts:\n- Will Durant was an American writer, historian, and philosopher who was born on November 5, 1885, and died on November 7, 1981.\n- Margaret Mitchell was an American author and journalist who was born on November 8, 1900, and died on August 16, 1949.\n- Gone with the Wind is a novel by American writer Margaret Mitchell that was first published in 1936.\n- The Minoan civilization has been described as the earliest civilization of its kind in Europe.\n- Historian Will Durant called the Minoans \"the first link in the European chain.\"",
